export anchor DarkLuxuryStyle:
    number: 296
    screen: CodeRepository
    name: Dark luxury
    idea: A hushed, symmetrical page of near black and fine gold hairlines, light display serif and widely spaced capitals, where the pull request reads like an invitation card and every figure has room.
    base: dark
    palette:
        noir: #0b0a08, the page and style sheet ground
        velvet: #12100d, the card gradient top and the diff panel
        ivory: #efe9dd, text
        taupe: #a39b8d, spaced capital labels and meta
        bronzeLine: #3d3528, quiet dividers and the outer card rule
        gold: #cdae6a, hairline rules, frames, ornaments and the primary button
        champagne: #e6cd92, gold text, figures, approved, links and focus
        ruby: #ec8b80, failing, changes requested and removed counts
        rubyShade: #22110f, removed diff lines
    type:
        A light display serif, Bodoni 72, Didot, Bodoni MT, Georgia, at
        weight 300 for the title at 52px, the repository at 34px, figures
        at 46px and names at 21px. A humanist sans, Optima, Candara, Gill
        Sans, Segoe UI, for body at 16px and 1.65 and for labels at 11px
        caps tracked 0.32em. The diff is 13px monospace at 1.85.
    layout:
        Everything is centred and symmetrical, up to 1160px. The header
        stacks a gold diamond monogram, BRIGHTWORK · CODE in gold spaced
        capitals, the repository in light serif with the name in italic
        champagne, and a row of spaced capital meta for Private, Watch,
        Star and Fork. A gold ornament rule with a small diamond leads to
        the tabs, a centred row of spaced capitals with counts as gold
        superscripts and a thin champagne underline on the current tab.
        The pull request is a centred card with a gold hairline and a
        second bronze rule 6px outside it. It holds Open and Pull request
        nº 214 in spaced capitals, the title, the merge sentence, then three
        equal columns split by hairlines for Checks with a big 11 of 12,
        Reviewers and Labels as outlined gold tags. Below the card two
        columns. The wide one holds Files changed with right aligned serif
        counts and the diff in a quiet panel, where the comment is a gold
        framed remark in italic serif. The narrow column centres assignee,
        labels, milestone and linked issue, an ornament rule and the
        disabled merge button. Below 960px it all stacks.
    spacing: An 8px unit used generously. 48px card padding, 64px between bands, 28px between side facts.
    density: Low. Few items per band with wide margins.
    corners: Square, with rotated diamond monogram and ornaments.
    borders: 1px gold hairlines, a bronze rule 6px outside the card, gold underlines on section headings.
    shadows: None. A faint velvet to noir gradient inside the card.
    icons:
        Thin 1.2px line icons, used sparingly. A ringed tick for approved,
        an octagon cross for failing, a triangle for changes requested, a
        lock on the merge, each with spaced capital words.
    focus: A 1px champagne outline offset 4px inside a soft gold halo.
    tone: Formal and spare, such as Pull request nº 214 and Merging opens once every check has passed.
